### RabbitMQ-1 API Requests
# Server: localhost:8083
# RabbitMQ: localhost:5673

### Send message to Direct Exchange
POST http://localhost:8083/api/send/direct?message=Direct Exchange Message

###

### Send message to Fanout Exchange
POST http://localhost:8083/api/send/fanout?message=Fanout Exchange Message

###

### Send message to Topic Exchange
POST http://localhost:8083/api/send/topic?message=Topic Exchange Message

###

### Send message to Headers Exchange
POST http://localhost:8083/api/send/headers?message=Headers Exchange Message

###

### ============================================
### CONSUMER ENDPOINTS - Manual Message Reading
### ============================================

### Consume message from Direct Exchange queue
GET http://localhost:8083/api/consume/direct

###

### Consume message from Fanout Exchange - Queue 1
GET http://localhost:8083/api/consume/fanout/1

###

### Consume message from Fanout Exchange - Queue 2
GET http://localhost:8083/api/consume/fanout/2

###

### Consume message from Topic Exchange queue
GET http://localhost:8083/api/consume/topic

###

### Consume message from Headers Exchange queue
GET http://localhost:8083/api/consume/headers

###